About the overlay version:
I appreciate having almost everything be overlays.  It keeps down on the
required ram, which is good if I'm multitasking under desqview.  I have a
large Disk cache, so loading in from disk is not that slow at all.  Here's
one thing, though: my cache is LRU I think, so odds are if it's not in
the Nethack ramspace, it's not in my cache space.  If nethack were biased
in it's caching, by LRU cache would probably be more effective.
